.* CFGDEVCMN: the task menu for device and communications configuration.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CFGDEVCMN'.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKCFGSTS PNLGRP=QHDCCMD1.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKDEVD PNLGRP=QHCFCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKHDWRSC PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CFGDEVCMN HELP=HLPCFGDEVCMN KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Configure Devices and Communications
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKHDWRSC TYPE(*LWS)' HELP=WRKHDWRSC.Configure local hardware
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='MENU CFGCMN' HELP='CFGDEVCMN/OPT2'.Configure communications and remote hardware
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*DSP)' HELP=WRKDEVD.Configure virtual controllers and devices
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKCFGSTS' HELP=WRKCFGSTS.Work with configuration status
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?RTVCFGSRC' HELP='CFGDEVCMN/OPT5'.Retrieve configuration source
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCFGDEVCMN.Configure Devices and Communications - Help
:P.The hardware attached to this system, the virtual display devices of
TN5250 sessions and the state of the configuration.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGDEVCMN/OPT2'.Configure communications and remote hardware
:P.Option 2. Shows menu CFGCMN&colon. Configure communications and
remote hardware.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CFGDEVCMN/OPT5'.Retrieve configuration source
:P.Option 5. Runs the RTVCFGSRC command&colon. Retrieve configuration
source.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
